# Phase-1 Step 4: 0 K Case-B diagnostic check on the 363 K end frame
# Force-converged minimization at FIXED box (same cell as production frame).
# 0 K is diagnostic only, not part of the production trajectory.
# Usage: lmp -in in.p1_casecheck -var kim_model ...
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       phase1/p1_annealed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.13599856 0.1693996 0.18969291) to (66.389212 66.355811 69.934037)
  2 by 2 by 3 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  14400 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  14400 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.070 seconds
pair_style      kim ${kim_model}
pair_style      kim SNAP_ZuoChenLi_2019_Li__MO_732106099012_000
pair_coeff      * * Li
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step pe pxx pyy pzz press lx ly lz

min_style       cg

variable        fmax_chunk equal fmax
variable        fnorm_chunk equal fnorm
variable        chunk loop 40

label           p1_cc_loop
minimize        0.0 1.0e-4 500 5000

